  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0 — BREAKING: structured scanning (JSON/XML/object) moved to the new RedactWire.Structured package; core no longer depends on System.Text.Json. Redactor.DetectJson/DetectXml/DetectObject removed — reference RedactWire.Structured and call Redactor.Default.DetectJson(...) or detector.DetectJson(...). Added: secret detection (AddSecretDetection), remove/replace built-in rules, region-based culture resolution. See CHANGELOG.md.",
